{% doc %}
  @prompt
    # Shopify AI Prompt — Klarna Payment Page
    
    Create a complete, responsive Klarna payment information page for an electric dirt bike brand.
    
    The overall design should feel clean, premium, minimal and trustworthy, with a white background, black typography and generous spacing.
    
    Do not use heavy card layouts, borders, shadows or unnecessary decorative elements.
    
    ## SECTION 1 — Klarna Introduction
    
    Create a centered section with a max width of approximately 1180px.
    
    ### Desktop
    
    Use a two-column layout.
    
    Left side:
    
    * Editable Klarna promotional image
    * Large image with rounded corners around 24–28px
    
    Right side:
    
    * Large bold heading
    * Short supporting paragraph
    * Vertically align the text naturally with the image
    
    Default heading:
    
    “It’s smooth and simple”
    
    Keep the image, heading and paragraph fully editable in the Shopify theme editor.
    
    ### Mobile
    
    Stack the section vertically:
    
    1. Image
    2. Heading
    3. Description
    
    The image should be full width within the mobile content area.
    
    Use approximately:
    
    * 20px horizontal page padding
    * 24–32px gap between image and text
    * Large but mobile-friendly heading size
    * Comfortable paragraph line height
    
    Do not make the text too small.
    
    ---
    
    ## SECTION 2 — Ways to Pay
    
    Below the introduction, create four editable Klarna payment information blocks.
    
    Default titles:
    
    * Monthly financing
    * 4 interest-free payments
    * Pay in 30 days
    * Flexible ways to pay
    
    Each block should include:
    
    * Bold heading
    * Editable paragraph
    * No border
    * No card background
    * No shadow
    
    ### Desktop
    
    Display the four blocks in a 2-column × 2-row layout.
    
    Use:
    
    * Balanced column widths
    * Approximately 40–60px horizontal gap
    * Approximately 45–60px vertical gap
    
    ### Mobile
    
    Stack all four blocks into one column.
    
    Use clear spacing between each block.
    
    Do not squeeze the blocks into two small columns on mobile.
    
    ---
    
    ## SECTION 3 — How to Shop with Klarna
    
    Add a bold heading:
    
    “How to shop with Klarna”
    
    Below it, create a 3-step shopping process.
    
    Each step includes:
    
    * Editable icon
    * Short editable description
    
    Default steps:
    
    Step 1:
    “Add your items to the cart and head to checkout.”
    
    Step 2:
    “Select Klarna at checkout and choose the payment option available to you.”
    
    Step 3:
    “Manage your order and payments through the Klarna app.”
    
    ### Desktop
    
    Display the three steps horizontally in three columns.
    
    Keep the icons small and clean.
    
    Do not place the steps inside cards.
    
    ### Mobile
    
    Stack the three steps vertically.
    
    Each step should display:
    
    * Icon on the left
    * Text on the right
    
    This should create a compact vertical step-by-step layout instead of three narrow columns.
    
    Add approximately 20–28px spacing between each step.
    
    ---
    
    ## SECTION 4 — Klarna Information
    
    Create a two-column information section.
    
    ### Left Column
    
    “The best way to shop.”
    
    Short supporting paragraph.
    
    “We’re always here to help!”
    
    Below this, allow editable FAQ-style content including topics such as:
    
    * Returns
    * Refunds
    * Order issues
    * Missing orders
    * Payment questions
    
    ### Right Column
    
    “Safe and secure.”
    
    Short paragraph explaining Klarna payment security.
    
    “About Klarna”
    
    Editable paragraph introducing Klarna.
    
    Allow an optional editable external link.
    
    ### Desktop
    
    Use two balanced columns with a generous gap between them.
    
    ### Mobile
    
    Stack all content into one column.
    
    Recommended mobile order:
    
    1. The best way to shop
    2. Safe and secure
    3. We’re always here to help
    4. About Klarna
    
    Keep paragraphs short and easy to scan.
    
    Do not display extremely long FAQ paragraphs by default.
    
    If possible, make FAQ questions collapsible accordion items on mobile.
    
    ---
    
    ## MOBILE DESIGN REQUIREMENTS
    
    Optimize the entire section specifically for mobile devices.
    
    Use approximately:
    
    * 20px left and right padding
    * 48–64px vertical spacing between major sections
    * 24–32px spacing between content blocks
    
    Headings should remain bold and visually clear without becoming oversized.
    
    Body text should remain readable and should not be smaller than approximately 14–16px.
    
    Use comfortable line height around 1.5–1.7.
    
    All images must scale responsively.
    
    Avoid horizontal scrolling.
    
    Avoid fixed widths.
    
    Do not force desktop multi-column layouts onto small screens.
    
    Buttons and links should have comfortable mobile tap areas.
    
    The mobile layout should feel intentionally designed, not simply a compressed desktop version.
    
    ---
    
    ## THEME EDITOR SETTINGS
    
    Make the following editable in the Shopify theme editor:
    
    * Images
    * Icons
    * Headings
    * Paragraphs
    * Links
    * Section spacing
    * Top and bottom padding
    * Mobile spacing
    * Image corner radius
    * Text alignment
    * Maximum content width
    
    Keep the overall design minimal, premium and consistent with Klarna’s clean visual language.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-klarna-page-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-klarna-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.intro_gap }}px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.section_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-intro-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-klarna-intro-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-klarna-intro-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-klarna-intro-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-klarna-intro-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-intro-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.intro_heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-klarna-intro-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.intro_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-klarna-ways-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.section_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-ways-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.ways_gap_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.ways_gap_horizontal }}px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-way-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-way-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.way_heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-klarna-way-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.way_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-klarna-how-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.section_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-how-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.how_heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.how_heading_margin }}px;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.how_heading_alignment }};
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-klarna-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.steps_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-klarna-step-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.step_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.step_icon_size }}px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-klarna-step-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-klarna-step-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-klarna-step-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
  }

  .ai-klarna-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-klarna-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.info_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-info-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.info_column_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-info-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.info_heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-klarna-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.info_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-klarna-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border: none;
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .ai-klarna-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 12px 0;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.faq_question_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-klarna-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-klarna-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-klarna-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}[aria-expanded="true"] .ai-klarna-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .ai-klarna-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-klarna-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    max-height: 500px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-faq-answer-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 0 0 12px 0;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.faq_answer_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-klarna-info-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.info_text_size }}px;
  }

  .ai-klarna-info-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-klarna-page-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.mobile_padding_bottom }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_intro_gap }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_section_spacing }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-intro-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_intro_heading_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-intro-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_intro_text_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-ways-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_section_spacing }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-ways-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_ways_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-way-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_way_heading_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-way-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_way_text_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-how-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_section_spacing }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-how-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_how_heading_size }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_how_heading_margin }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_steps_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: row;
      text-align: left;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-step-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.mobile_step_icon_size }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.mobile_step_icon_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_step_text_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_info_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_info_heading_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_info_text_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_faq_question_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-faq-answer-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_faq_answer_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-klarna-info-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_info_text_size }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<klarna-payment-page-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-klarna-page-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-klarna-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-klarna-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-klarna-intro-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.intro_image %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.intro_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.intro_image.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.intro_image.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.intro_image.height }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-klarna-intro-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="ai-klarna-intro-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.intro_heading != blank %}
          <h1 class="ai-klarna-intro-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.intro_heading }}</h1>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.intro_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-klarna-intro-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.intro_text }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-klarna-ways-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-klarna-ways-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.way_1_enabled %}
          <div class="ai-klarna-way-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.way_1_heading != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-klarna-way-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.way_1_heading }}</h3>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.way_1_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-klarna-way-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.way_1_text }}</div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.way_2_enabled %}
          <div class="ai-klarna-way-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.way_2_heading != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-klarna-way-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.way_2_heading }}</h3>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.way_2_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-klarna-way-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.way_2_text }}</div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.way_3_enabled %}
          <div class="ai-klarna-way-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.way_3_heading != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-klarna-way-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.way_3_heading }}</h3>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.way_3_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-klarna-way-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.way_3_text }}</div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.way_4_enabled %}
          <div class="ai-klarna-way-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.way_4_heading != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-klarna-way-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.way_4_heading }}</h3>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.way_4_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-klarna-way-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.way_4_text }}</div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-klarna-how-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.how_heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-klarna-how-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.how_heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="ai-klarna-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-klarna-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-klarna-step-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_1_icon %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.step_1_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="Step 1"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-klarna-step-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          {% if block.settings.step_1_text != blank %}
            <p class="ai-klarna-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_1_text }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="ai-klarna-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-klarna-step-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_2_icon %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.step_2_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="Step 2"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-klarna-step-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          {% if block.settings.step_2_text != blank %}
            <p class="ai-klarna-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_2_text }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="ai-klarna-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-klarna-step-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_3_icon %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.step_3_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="Step 3"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-klarna-step-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          {% if block.settings.step_3_text != blank %}
            <p class="ai-klarna-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_3_text }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-klarna-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-klarna-info-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-klarna-info-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.best_way_heading != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-klarna-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.best_way_heading }}</h3>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.best_way_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-klarna-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.best_way_text }}</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="ai-klarna-info-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.help_heading != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-klarna-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.help_heading }}</h3>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.help_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-klarna-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.help_text }}</div>
          {% endif %}
          
          <div class="ai-klarna-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.faq_1_question != blank %}
              <div class="ai-klarna-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <button
                  class="ai-klarna-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  data-faq-toggle
                >
                  {{ block.settings.faq_1_question }}
                  <svg class="ai-klarna-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
                  </svg>
                </button>
                <div class="ai-klarna-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <div class="ai-klarna-faq-answer-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.faq_1_answer }}</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.faq_2_question != blank %}
              <div class="ai-klarna-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <button
                  class="ai-klarna-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  data-faq-toggle
                >
                  {{ block.settings.faq_2_question }}
